{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_963.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"7d351d330b4d49ec1c5a94ec550eb2cae6f84bed9008b00fe4ce39f79a0116cb","ja":"いつもとちがうステージ","zh":"与平时不同的舞台","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_963.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"3e2607bec480a3b17fd2d99012af941815f9bcfb610e887e08b84c179b62c472","ja":"今日のステージ……ヴァイオリンのコンクールを\n思い出します。この静けさとか……。","zh":"今天的舞台……让我想起了小提琴比赛。\n这份宁静……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_963.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e2d711f90ac7a182095415fd40cf76088a65e15f9347e2fd37cbc9d107f9ca63","ja":"私もバレエの発表会みたいだなって思ってた……！\n劇場とかライブハウスとかとは、全然違うね。","zh":"我也觉得这就像芭蕾舞发表会……！\n跟剧场或者Live House之类的完全不一样呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_963.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"496cb8d9520f72635e216677dab2645ccd1397db50e0d40d1e38368d3367097b","ja":"はい。お客さん達、みんな正装して\n座席に静かに座っています……。","zh":"是的。观众们都身着正装，\n安静地坐在座位上……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_963.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1d11724812f6d15d0ac9a3dcd24fd9d4669d34eca79d3e4cb34e8dc43874f6b6","ja":"まさか本格的な舞台芸術の公演に出演することに\nなるなんて……。これは気合入れていかなきゃだね。","zh":"没想到竟然会出演正式舞台艺术的公演……。\n这下必须鼓足干劲了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_963.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"fcfddd24161dd61af24d2d4ef76c78d7d0b55a9b49fff57039e0873c203594a6","ja":"一緒に盛り上がるというより、\nじっくり観賞されるっていう感じがします……。","zh":"与其说是一起热闹起来，更像是会被细细欣赏的感觉……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_963.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"3d88a7561d1fc8145fee713840050ebcf382a714359d37f16000000493290c67","ja":"一発勝負のアートステージ！\nミスは絶対に許されません！","zh":"一决胜负的艺术舞台！\n绝对不允许失误！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_963.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"fcf9c2ab46c6fd0946f222b91fe6cc8d0afa3b9676b3d6cdbba78dde7866b2cb","ja":"ロコちゃん、気合を入れるのはいいことだけど……\nそんなに緊張しなくても大丈夫よ。","zh":"ROCO，鼓足干劲是好事，不过……\n不用那么紧张也没关系哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_963.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"5ca975e810e4ef6020284f4c3364f55a6e278c3739ca3807fb0311a2e4b9e45c","ja":"4人で踊るんだから、なにかあっても\nお互いにサポートできるんだもの。","zh":"因为要和4人一起跳舞，所以就算发生了什么\n我们也能互相支持。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_963.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"41cada5c594cc90f860f6900a71985e78bfbd83322e24a775a33be5bbb0fb73f","ja":"アズサ……はい！　アウェイであろうと\nみんなで表現することを楽しみます……！","zh":"梓……好的！　即使是客场\n我也会和大家一起享受表演的……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_963.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"6cec1526b454ead849efa8cfe64055556402f280c76013a40e3228766f11647e","ja":"ふふ、それでこそロコちゃんね♪\nではみんな、行きましょうか。","zh":"呵呵，这才对嘛，ROCO♪\n那么大家，出发吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
